{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b0c87730e5f3a14c29fcff351af421ebc3cc63ad09afced658e709747da40cb4", "ja": "あ、いたいたあずささん、実は……。\nって、ずいぶんとご機嫌ですね。", "zh": "啊，找到你了，梓小姐。其实……\n咦？你好像心情不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "6c8d78aeb66930cfe50ec93c2dc240abc358bcfb1d60fe2c8ab7508f5b4cfa1a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nはい、私、今とってもご機嫌なんです。うふふっ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n是啊，我现在心情非常好喔，唔呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "d7dfc56fd33c5a1d50bb1abe957e5cf412b4ed2cffdf2dde25e5c32a4febf5e4", "ja": "だって、こんなに素敵な衣装をいただいてしまったん\nですから♪　……あの、似合いますか？", "zh": "因为，我拿到了这么棒的服装♪\n……请问，还适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8122aee49c2f362d32b394369e552adf87b36daff60776ce21188eaf3dc198a6", "ja": "ええ、よく似合ってますよ。\n童話に出てくるお姫さまみたいです！", "zh": "嗯，很适合喔。\n就像是童话里头的公主一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "4403dbea5a1c298b83f64969d4f96019da3cb54f2b6267c0dc952019438944f3", "ja": "まぁ、{$P$}さんったら。\nふふっ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生真会说话。\n呵呵，谢谢夸奖♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "409e830dd4a726462c9562444b6646bac38fbff25e8b120a6e75d1b86895c82c", "ja": "童話のお姫さまといえば、みんなの憧れですから……。\n夢をこわさないよう、私もがんばりますね。", "zh": "童话里的公主是许多人的向往……\n我得好好加油，才不会破坏大家的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c93b8b01cce4dcd1b36a67f2eb751483576d05609d33d1f5fc67e54977c090d0", "ja": "もしかして、あずささんも\nお姫さまに憧れていたんですか？", "zh": "难道说，\n梓小姐以前对公主也很向往？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "eea07d9807f3b4de25a6bb27e2c8bc142d981eacf3528d896626dad363b71bd4", "ja": "はい、もちろんです♪　お気に入りの絵本を何度も\n読み直したり、大事に抱えたまま眠ったり……。", "zh": "是啊，那当然啰♪我不只会把喜欢的图画书\n看过一遍又一遍，还会很宝贝地抱着它入睡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "08d4ad7b8689a8fe96076d5b4126eb924f7caf2fa78d91afa79ca4a2928ab181", "ja": "そう思うと、私はこの衣装のおかげで、\n夢をかなえてもらえたのかもしれません♪", "zh": "这样说起来，\n这套服装或许让我实现了小时候的梦想呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cc526feb8aee69eb04c503dcacf4de40ebdfa17c3e68d6eec857aabe5481724a", "ja": "はは、それはよかったです。せっかくだから、\nガラスの靴も一緒に作ってもらえばよかったかな。", "zh": "哈哈，那真是太好了。\n难得有这机会，应该顺便订制一双玻璃鞋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "542a6d6766e8d6ec0183fd2dffb5bf92e01e79c7c2c4af2c7c579a50e868f4d2", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね。\nガラスの靴をはいて、シンデレラはお城に……。", "zh": "呵呵，也许不错呢。\n灰姑娘穿上玻璃鞋，前往城堡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2767fb6c0ee6d41d851eacdf7a7bc61b373587f20d9c87bfe20eeb9b0f30c68a", "ja": "……あれ。どうかしましたか？", "zh": "……嗯？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "81abb302b0c6862af15ca3191274f13a1ebaaaff96c2d6da67ab8e604e98028a", "ja": "いいえ、{$P$}さん。\nガラスの靴なら、もういただいています。", "zh": "没什么，{$P$}先生。\n要说玻璃鞋的话，我已经收到啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "5c7347a026a43a34f0b53200f58113042e98457796b42b974a56ff6b44db9ad9", "ja": "こうして私をお姫さまにしてもらえたのは、\n私がアイドルだから……。", "zh": "我现在能打扮成公主的模样，\n是因为我是偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
