{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "bd9767eef32314f3e805f233fd7048e8ead9ec20b49f254cdf5a6dd22c1dd41c", "ja": "その靴をはかせてくださった方とも……。\nもう、出会えていますから。", "zh": "为我穿上玻璃鞋的人……\n我也已经遇到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "梓小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "79304f74d92bbdc1bdf2ead7f54045e02430ef4f48a8518d7f5c7886dcb86c3c", "ja": "{$P$}さん。ガラスの靴をはいた私と\nこれからも……、歩いていただけますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n你以后也愿意跟穿上玻璃鞋的我……继续走下去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
