{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0104_2000_p", "source_sha256": "02a3928023cf5d34cb88d64e8894128c836c2f31b4a3545e23890f02b8f6820c", "ja": "……はい。まだまだ先は長いですからね。\nこれからも、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "……是啊，毕竟往顶尖偶像的路途还很漫长。\n今后也请你多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
